79
00:04:24.347 --> 00:04:26.864
Intuition: past behaviour as evidence.

80
00:04:27.144 --> 00:04:32.819
An interviewer can't watch you work for six months, so they ask what you did in specific situations.

81
00:04:33.099 --> 00:04:38.773
The assumption is that past behaviour in similar situations is the best available predictor.

82
00:04:39.053 --> 00:04:45.645
That's why hypothetical answers (I would...) score poorly, and specific ones (Last March I...) score well.

